/ a small fixture table for cmd/units's own cases -- NOT a cut-down copy of ../units,
/ which every other case names directly.  Two dimensions and a handful of definitions,
/ so that a `-' dump is short enough to be an expectation a reader can check.

/ dimensions

m			*a*
sec			*c*

/ constants

fuzz			1
pi			3.14159265358979323846

/ lengths

cm			1|100 m
inch			2.54 cm
foot			12 inch

/ out of range on this machine: 1e+30 overflows and 1e-30 underflows, so both are
/ dropped with a diagnostic.  ../units has six of these commented out instead.

big			1+30
tiny			1-30
